  m_text: 'Controls:

    Movement - "WASD"

    Jump - "Spacebar"

    Sprint -
    "LeftShift"

    Interact - "E"


    Objectives:

    Take the teleporter to
    navigate a maze and retrieve an item needed to repair your ship

    Return to
    the ship and repair your ship, this will grant you access to the next teleporter
    area

    Avoid many traps and hazards to retrieve the final item.

    Return
    to your ship with the item in hand to fix your ship and return home



'
